# KIT: the squad goes quiet, closes on the nearest man who is not theirs, throws what it carries at him on order, covers him,
# then goes loud, holds and falls in; and again.
# REACHES: going silent and loud, the move order, the throws' page (a flash and a frag thrown by a teammate on order), cover,
# hold, fall in. A floor's kit may not bring these, and the throws want a line: `mousehole-four` has them all.
# DOES NOT REACH: a pair's orders on a man (hands/pair.hand), smoke and the wand under a door (no mission's kit brings them to a menu),
# the 40 mm (no floor here stages shells: its own test is tests/orders.rs), wall charges, working a thing.
unhurt
at 1               order silent sam all
every 20 from 2    order move nearest all
every 20 from 9    order stunThere nearest all
every 20 from 13   order fragThere nearest all
every 20 from 16   order cover nearest all
every 40 from 25   order loud sam all
every 40 from 27   order hold sam all
every 40 from 37   order fallIn sam all
